"menyanyi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid ""
"In this experiment, you may be asked to make a voice or video recording."
msgstr ""
"Dalam percubaan ini, anda mungkin diminta membuat rakaman suara atau video."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "(Please tick where applicable)"
msgstr "(Sila tandakan di mana berkenaan)"

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "Addendum for demonstrations"
msgstr "Tambahan untuk demonstrasi"

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"I agree that my <i>audiovisual</i> recordings can be used for demonstration "
"purposes in presentations with a limited number of participants (e.g., "
"teaching courses or scientific presentations)."
msgstr ""
"Saya bersetuju bahawa rakaman <i>audiovisual</i> saya boleh digunakan untuk "
"tujuan demonstrasi dalam pembentangan dengan bilangan peserta yang terhad "
"(cth., kursus pengajaran atau pembentangan saintifik)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "NO"
msgstr "TIDAK"

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "YES"
msgstr "YA"

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"By making recording people while moving, singing, tapping to rhythms, or "
"speaking, we can infer the mechanisms of the auditory and visual systems."
msgstr ""
"Dengan membuat rakaman orang semasa bergerak, menyanyi, mengetik mengikut "
"irama, atau bercakap, kita boleh membuat kesimpulan tentang mekanisme sistem"
" pendengaran dan visual."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"For example, we would like to understand how predictive mechanisms in "
"perception rely on experience, learning, and memory."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, kami ingin memahami bagaimana mekanisme ramalan dalam "
"persepsi bergantung pada pengalaman, pembelajaran dan ingatan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I agree to the handling of the recordings as described above."
msgstr ""
"Saya bersetuju dengan pengendalian rakaman seperti yang dinyatakan di atas."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I had sufficient time for this decision."
msgstr "Saya mempunyai masa yang mencukupi untuk keputusan ini."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"I have been informed that the storage and processing of the "
"<i>audiovisual</i> recording will be carried out in pseudonymized form, "
"i.e., using a number and without containing my name, and that there is a "
"coding list that links my name to the number."
msgstr ""
"Saya telah dimaklumkan bahawa penyimpanan dan pemprosesan rakaman "
"<i>audiovisual</i> akan dijalankan dalam bentuk nama samaran, iaitu, "
"menggunakan nombor dan tanpa mengandungi nama saya, dan terdapat senarai "
"pengekodan yang memautkan nama saya kepada nombor."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"I have read and understood everything and hereby agree that "
"<i>audiovisual</i> recordings of me may be taken."
msgstr ""
"Saya telah membaca dan memahami segala-galanya dan dengan ini bersetuju "
"bahawa rakaman <i>audiovisual</i> saya boleh diambil."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I have received a copy of this consent form."
msgstr "Saya telah menerima salinan borang kebenaran ini."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"I have received oral and written information about the fact that "
"<i>audiovisual</i> recordings will be made in this study."
msgstr ""
"Saya telah menerima maklumat lisan dan bertulis tentang fakta bahawa rakaman"
" <i>audiovisual</i> akan dibuat dalam kajian ini."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I may withdraw my consent at any time."
msgstr "Saya boleh menarik balik persetujuan saya pada bila-bila masa."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"In case of refusal or withdrawal, no costs will be incurred nor will there "
"be other negative consequences; however, in this case, participation in the "
"study will not be possible."
msgstr ""
"Sekiranya penolakan atau penarikan balik, tiada kos akan ditanggung dan "
"tidak akan ada akibat negatif lain; bagaimanapun, dalam kes ini, penyertaan "
"dalam kajian tidak akan dapat dilakukan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"Researchers associated with this project will have access to my "
"<i>audiovisual</i> data during the recording and the analysis of the "
"material."
msgstr ""
"Penyelidik yang dikaitkan dengan projek ini akan mempunyai akses kepada data"
" <i>audiovisual</i> saya semasa rakaman dan analisis bahan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"The declaration of consent for <i>audiovisual</i> recordings is voluntary."
msgstr ""
"Pengisytiharan persetujuan untuk rakaman <i>audiovisual</i> adalah secara "
"sukarela."

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"The investigators are the only persons who have access to this coding list, "
"which will be destroyed after completion of the research project."
