#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study how people from different places in "
"the world experience sounds (e.g., speech, music) and images (e.g., faces, "
"color)."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan projek ini adalah untuk mengkaji cara orang dari tempat yang berbeza "
"di dunia mengalami bunyi (cth., pertuturan, muzik) dan imej (cth., muka, "
"warna)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Confidentiality"
msgstr "Kerahsiaan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "Compensation"
msgstr "Pampasan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid ""
"Although it may not directly benefit you, this study may benefit society by "
"helping us understanding how humans derive information from sound and "
"vision, and potentially to help engineer machines that can replicate our "
"abilities (e.g. in sound recognition and computer vision) and to help "
"improve perceptual abilities in people whose hearing or sight is impaired."
msgstr ""
"Walaupun ia mungkin tidak memberi manfaat langsung kepada anda, kajian ini "
"mungkin memberi manfaat kepada masyarakat dengan membantu kami memahami cara"
" manusia memperoleh maklumat daripada bunyi dan penglihatan, dan berpotensi "
"untuk membantu mesin jurutera yang boleh meniru kebolehan kami (cth. dalam "
"pengecaman bunyi dan penglihatan komputer) dan untuk membantu meningkatkan "
"kebolehan persepsi pada orang yang mempunyai gangguan pendengaran atau "
"penglihatan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr "Faedah"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"For the purpose of helping scientific progress and replication, sometimes we"
" may share the data with research collaborators."
msgstr ""
"Untuk tujuan membantu kemajuan saintifik dan replikasi, kadangkala kami "
"mungkin berkongsi data dengan rakan usaha sama penyelidikan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we will only share fully anonymized data, such as "
"demographic, aggregated, or extracted data without any personal identifiers."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kes ini, kami hanya akan berkongsi data tanpa nama sepenuhnya, seperti"
" data demografi, agregat atau diekstrak tanpa sebarang pengecam peribadi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid "Research collaborations"
msgstr "Kerjasama penyelidikan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All of the information we obtain during the research will be kept "
"confidential."
msgstr ""
"Semua maklumat yang kami perolehi semasa penyelidikan akan dirahsiakan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your alpha numeric code to derive your "
"real identity, this record could be linked in some cases to your public "
"profile page if a data breach takes place."
msgstr ""
"Walaupun penyelidik tidak akan menggunakan kod angka alfa anda untuk "
"mendapatkan identiti sebenar anda, rekod ini boleh dipautkan dalam beberapa "
"kes ke halaman profil awam anda jika pelanggaran data berlaku."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Consenting to these additional requirements is also fully voluntary."
msgstr "Mempersetujui keperluan tambahan ini juga secara sukarela sepenuhnya."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If an experiment is collecting data that cannot be fully anonymized, we will"
" inform you and also ask for additional consent."
msgstr ""
"Jika percubaan mengumpul data yang tidak boleh awanama sepenuhnya, kami akan"
" memaklumkan anda dan juga meminta persetujuan tambahan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"No personal identifiers (e.g. your name or contact data) will be collected "
"or used at any stage of the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Tiada pengecam peribadi (cth. nama atau data hubungan anda) akan dikumpul "
"atau digunakan pada mana-mana peringkat percubaan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"These include experiments where we make audio-visual recordings or where we "
"need your contact details to contact you in the future to take another "
"experiment."
msgstr ""
"Ini termasuk percubaan di mana kami membuat rakaman audio-visual atau di "
"mana kami memerlukan butiran hubungan anda untuk menghubungi anda pada masa "
"hadapan untuk mengambil percubaan lain."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"This code will not be used to derive your real identity, will not be shared "
"with anyone outside of the research team and will be deleted after use."
msgstr ""
"Kod ini tidak akan digunakan untuk mendapatkan identiti sebenar anda, tidak "
"akan dikongsi dengan sesiapa di luar pasukan penyelidikan dan akan "
"dipadamkan selepas digunakan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Thus, the experimental data is anonymous."
msgstr "Oleh itu, data percubaan adalah tanpa nama."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to restrict what information you choose to share "
"publicly."
msgstr ""
"Oleh itu, anda mungkin ingin mengehadkan maklumat yang anda pilih untuk "
"dikongsi secara terbuka."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We may collect some demographic data (e.g. age, gender, country of "
"residence) as well as information about your learning and exposure history "
"(e.g. musical experience playing an instrument, years of formal education, "
"languages spoken)."
msgstr ""
"Kami mungkin mengumpul beberapa data demografi (cth. umur, jantina, negara "
"tempat tinggal) serta maklumat tentang sejarah pembelajaran dan pendedahan "
"anda (cth. pengalaman muzik memainkan alat, tahun pendidikan formal, bahasa "
"yang dituturkan)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We will only save your anonymized alpha numeric code in our system, in order"
" to distinguish participants who have already taken part in this or other "
"experiments."
msgstr ""
"Kami hanya akan menyimpan kod angka alfa tanpa nama anda dalam sistem kami, "
"untuk membezakan peserta yang telah mengambil bahagian dalam percubaan ini "
"atau lain-lain."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Finally, in some experiments you may be asked to make a voice or video "
"recording, for example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in "
"response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""
"Akhir sekali, dalam beberapa eksperimen, anda mungkin diminta membuat "
"rakaman suara atau video, sebagai contoh, anda mungkin diminta untuk merakam"
" ketukan jari anda sebagai tindak balas kepada bunyi atau video, atau "
"merakam diri anda bercakap atau menyanyi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to judge how pleasant a particular sound or an"
" image is, or to categorize sounds or images (e.g., if a sound or an image "
"is that of a car or a cow), or to judge other basic features of sounds or "
"images (e.g., how frequently do you encounter this type of sound or image? "
"how aesthetically pleasing you consider a particular sound or image?)."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, anda mungkin diminta untuk menilai betapa menariknya bunyi "
"atau imej tertentu, atau untuk mengkategorikan bunyi atau imej (cth., jika "
"bunyi atau imej ialah bunyi kereta atau lembu), atau menilai ciri asas lain "
"bunyi atau imej (cth., berapa kerapkah anda menghadapi jenis bunyi atau imej"
" ini? sejauh manakah anda menganggap bunyi atau imej tertentu secara "
"estetik?)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If the experiment will contain these elements we will ask for an additional "
"consent."
msgstr ""
"Jika percubaan akan mengandungi elemen ini, kami akan meminta persetujuan "
"tambahan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If you volunteer to participate in this study, you will be asked to perform "
"simple tasks using your keyboard or mouse while listening to sounds, or "
"while observing images or videos."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda secara sukarela mengambil bahagian dalam kajian ini, anda akan "
"diminta untuk melaksanakan tugas mudah menggunakan papan kekunci atau "
"tetikus anda sambil mendengar bunyi, atau semasa memerhati imej atau video."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"In some experiments, we may use mild deception, i.e., we may not explain the"
" full truth regarding an experimental task (for example we will not tell you"
" that an image was generated by an artificial computer system and not a "
"human)."
msgstr ""
"Dalam sesetengah percubaan, kami mungkin menggunakan penipuan ringan, iaitu,"
" kami mungkin tidak menerangkan kebenaran penuh mengenai tugas percubaan "
"(contohnya kami tidak akan memberitahu anda bahawa imej dihasilkan oleh "
"sistem komputer tiruan dan bukan manusia)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Mild deception will only be used in some experiments where we need to "
"prevent biasing the participants before taking the experiment."
msgstr ""
"Penipuan ringan hanya akan digunakan dalam beberapa eksperimen di mana kita "
"perlu mengelakkan bias peserta sebelum mengambil percubaan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr "Prosedur"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"The specific sounds, images, and videos used will vary, but may include: "
"recordings of ambient sounds, noise-bursts, speech, music, simple tones, "
"naturalistic images, animated images, comics, faces, objects, geometric "
"shapes, fractal images, or videos of natural environments."
msgstr ""
"Bunyi, imej dan video tertentu yang digunakan akan berbeza-beza, tetapi "
"mungkin termasuk: rakaman bunyi ambien, letupan hingar, pertuturan, muzik, "
"nada ringkas, imej naturalistik, imej animasi, komik, muka, objek, bentuk "
"geometri, imej fraktal, atau video persekitaran semula jadi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Tujuan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "For the Max-Planck-Society, this is:"
msgstr "Untuk Max-Planck-Society, ini ialah:"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"Note that in some studies data deletion will not be possible, in this case "
"we will ask you specifically to consent to this procedure in a separate "
"consent form."
msgstr ""
"Ambil perhatian bahawa dalam sesetengah kajian pemadaman data tidak akan "
"dapat dilakukan, dalam kes ini kami akan meminta anda secara khusus untuk "
"bersetuju dengan prosedur ini dalam borang persetujuan yang berasingan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You also have the right to submit an objection to the supervisory authority."
msgstr ""
"Anda juga mempunyai hak untuk mengemukakan bantahan kepada pihak berkuasa "
"penyeliaan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You have the right to information regarding the data relating to you that is"
" stored at the Max-Planck-Institute, the right to correct inaccurate data, "
"and the right to demand the deletion of data in cases of inadmissible data "
"storage and the right to data portability."
msgstr ""
"Anda mempunyai hak untuk mendapatkan maklumat mengenai data yang berkaitan "
"dengan anda yang disimpan di Max-Planck-Institute, hak untuk membetulkan "
"data yang tidak tepat, dan hak untuk menuntut pemadaman data dalam kes "
"penyimpanan data yang tidak boleh diterima dan hak untuk data mudah alih."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr "Hak awak"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid "Risks/Discomforts"
msgstr "Risiko/Ketidakselesaan"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid ""
"There are no risks for participating in this study beyond those associated "
"with normal computer use."
msgstr ""
"Tiada risiko untuk mengambil bahagian dalam kajian ini melebihi risiko yang "
"berkaitan dengan penggunaan komputer biasa."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be stored temporarily on external servers and desktops/laptops "
"that are password protected."
msgstr ""
"Data akan disimpan sementara pada pelayan luaran dan desktop/komputer riba "
"yang dilindungi kata laluan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "No data will be stored permanently on external servers."
msgstr "Tiada data akan disimpan secara kekal pada pelayan luaran."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data will be then stored permanently in the institute servers with hard "
"disks encrypted using industry-standard encryption software."
msgstr ""
"Data tersebut kemudiannya akan disimpan secara kekal dalam pelayan institut "
"dengan cakera keras yang disulitkan menggunakan perisian penyulitan standard"
" industri."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"The investigator may withdraw you from this research if circumstances arise "
"which warrant doing so."
msgstr ""
"Penyiasat boleh menarik anda daripada penyelidikan ini jika timbul keadaan "
"yang mewajarkan berbuat demikian."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Voluntary participation"
msgstr "Penyertaan sukarela"

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to discontinue participation in this study at any time without "
"penalty."
msgstr ""
"Anda bebas untuk menghentikan penyertaan dalam kajian ini pada bila-bila "
"masa tanpa penalti."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to refuse to take part, and you may stop taking part at any "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Anda bebas untuk menolak untuk mengambil bahagian, dan anda boleh berhenti "
"mengambil bahagian pada bila-bila masa."

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Your participation in this research is voluntary."
msgstr "Penyertaan anda dalam penyelidikan ini adalah secara sukarela."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"Following open science practices to improve science reusability and "
"replicability, we may want to publish the dataset collected in this "
"experiment as soon as the study is finished."
msgstr ""
"Mengikuti amalan sains terbuka untuk meningkatkan kebolehgunaan semula dan "
"kebolehulangan sains, kami mungkin mahu menerbitkan set data yang dikumpul "
"dalam percubaan ini sebaik sahaja kajian selesai."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"This includes audio-visual recordings, such as a recording of your finger-"
"tapping in response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or "
"singing."
msgstr ""
"Ini termasuk rakaman audio-visual, seperti rakaman ketukan jari anda sebagai"
" tindak balas kepada bunyi atau video, atau untuk merakam diri anda bercakap"
" atau menyanyi."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"We may also want to publish certain materials as part of the scientific "
"publication, such as a demo video of the task or part of an interview."
msgstr ""
"Kami juga mungkin mahu menerbitkan bahan tertentu sebagai sebahagian "
"daripada penerbitan saintifik, seperti video tunjuk cara tugas atau "
"sebahagian daripada temu bual."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"However, your data will not be directly associated with your name or other "
"identifiers in any way (we will not specify your name when presenting "
"audio/video materials of yours)."
msgstr ""
"Walau bagaimanapun, data anda tidak akan dikaitkan secara langsung dengan "
"nama anda atau pengecam lain dalam apa jua cara (kami tidak akan menyatakan "
"nama anda semasa mempersembahkan bahan audio/video anda)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Since the audio-visual recordings collected in this experiment may be made "
"public, we cannot guarantee anonymity of your data if you participate in "
"this experiment."
msgstr ""
"Memandangkan rakaman audio-visual yang dikumpul dalam percubaan ini mungkin "
"didedahkan kepada umum, kami tidak dapat menjamin kerahasiaan data anda jika"
" anda mengambil bahagian dalam percubaan ini."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Although your data will not be associated with personal identifiers, it is "
"possible to link your personal information based on audio-visual recordings"
msgstr ""
"Walaupun data anda tidak akan dikaitkan dengan pengecam peribadi, adalah "
"mungkin untuk memautkan maklumat peribadi anda berdasarkan rakaman audio-"
"visual"

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"By consenting to this experiment you are committing not to use profanity "
"while recording audio or nudity while recording video."
msgstr ""
"Dengan bersetuju dengan percubaan ini, anda komited untuk tidak menggunakan "
"kata-kata kotor semasa merakam audio atau kebogelan semasa merakam video."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid "Disclaimer"
msgstr "Penafian"

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Since some materials will be published as part of the scientific "
"publication, you will not be able to delete such materials, as they will "
"become public (either immediately or soon after data collection)."
msgstr ""
"Memandangkan sesetengah bahan akan diterbitkan sebagai sebahagian daripada "
"penerbitan saintifik, anda tidak akan dapat memadamkan bahan tersebut, "
"kerana ia akan menjadi umum (sama ada serta-merta atau tidak lama selepas "
"pengumpulan data)."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to make sure you do not record any materials you do not "
"want to make public."
msgstr ""
"Oleh itu, anda mungkin ingin memastikan anda tidak merekodkan sebarang bahan"
" yang anda tidak mahu umumkan."

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be published on open science frameworks/websites such as OSF "
"(https://osf.io/) and will be available to everybody with internet access."
msgstr ""
"Data akan diterbitkan pada rangka kerja/tapak web sains terbuka seperti OSF "
"(https://osf.io/) dan akan tersedia kepada semua orang yang mempunyai akses "
"internet."

#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "By doing the task you are helping science, thank you!"
msgstr "Dengan melakukan tugas anda membantu sains, terima kasih!"

#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"This study is completely voluntary; you will not receive any monetary "
"compensation for participation."
msgstr ""
"Kajian ini adalah secara sukarela sepenuhnya; anda tidak akan menerima "
"sebarang pampasan wang untuk penyertaan."

#: psynet/templates/exit_recruiter_lucid.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "exit_recruiter_lucid"
msgid "Lucid Survey Submission"
msgstr "Penyerahan Tinjauan Lucid"

#: psynet/templates/final-page-rejected-consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "final_page_rejected_consent"
