#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will be shared only if your consent to an additional "
"consent form as explained above."
msgstr ""
"Bahan audio-visual akan dikongsi hanya jika anda bersetuju dengan borang "
"kebenaran tambahan seperti yang dijelaskan di atas."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we may share your audio-visual material along with fully "
"anonymized data, such as demographic, aggregated, or extracted data."
msgstr ""
"Dalam kes ini, kami mungkin berkongsi bahan audio-visual anda bersama-sama "
"dengan data tanpa nama sepenuhnya, seperti data demografi, agregat atau "
"diekstrak."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"We will never connect your real name or any of your personal information "
"directly to your image or sound recording, even though it is off course "
"possible to recognize individuals based on audio-visual material."
msgstr ""
"Kami tidak akan sekali-kali menyambungkan nama sebenar anda atau mana-mana "
"maklumat peribadi anda secara langsung kepada imej atau rakaman bunyi anda, "
"walaupun sudah tentu mungkin untuk mengenali individu berdasarkan bahan "
"audio-visual."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All the recordings we obtain during this research will be kept confidential,"
" and nobody outside the group of researchers will be able to share or store "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Semua rakaman yang kami peroleh semasa penyelidikan ini akan dirahsiakan dan"
" tiada sesiapa di luar kumpulan penyelidik akan dapat berkongsi atau "
"menyimpannya."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your recordings to derive your real "
"identity, personal information could be leaked if you are not in an isolated"
" environment."
msgstr ""
"Walaupun penyelidik tidak akan menggunakan rakaman anda untuk mendapatkan "
"identiti sebenar anda, maklumat peribadi boleh dibocorkan jika anda tidak "
"berada dalam persekitaran terpencil."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"By consenting to this experiment, you are committing not to use profanity "
"while recording audio or nudity while recording video."
msgstr ""
"Dengan bersetuju dengan percubaan ini, anda komited untuk tidak menggunakan "
"kata-kata kotor semasa merakam audio atau kebogelan semasa merakam video."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to sit in a room that is isolated from the rest of"
" the house."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai contoh, anda mungkin mahu duduk di dalam bilik yang terpencil dari "
"seluruh rumah."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"However, in some experiments, your recordings may be seen or heard by other "
"participants in order to evaluate them in different attributes or create new"
" materials (for example replicate a rhythm that you created, or continue a "
"melody that you sang)."
msgstr ""
"Walau bagaimanapun, dalam sesetengah percubaan, rakaman anda mungkin dilihat"
" atau didengar oleh peserta lain untuk menilai mereka dalam atribut yang "
"berbeza atau mencipta bahan baharu (contohnya meniru irama yang anda cipta "
"atau meneruskan melodi yang anda nyanyikan)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If you choose to participate in the experiment, it is important and your "
"responsibility to make sure that while you record audio and video nothing "
"that you don’t intend to be recorded is recorded."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda memilih untuk mengambil bahagian dalam percubaan, adalah penting "
"dan tanggungjawab anda untuk memastikan bahawa semasa anda merakam audio dan"
" video tiada apa yang anda tidak berniat untuk dirakamkan dirakam."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Raw audio/video will not be shared with collaborators (we will only share "
"extracted data from recordings without personal identifiers)."
msgstr ""
"Audio/video mentah tidak akan dikongsi dengan rakan usaha sama (kami hanya "
"akan berkongsi data yang diekstrak daripada rakaman tanpa pengecam "
"peribadi)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"You may wish to make sure that no sounds/visual material in your environment"
" could be linked to your personal information. In addition, while you "
"perform a recording, the microphone or camera can capture unintended audio "
"or video, for example the camera can capture another family member, or the "
"microphone can capture something you say to another person."
msgstr ""
"Anda mungkin ingin memastikan bahawa tiada bunyi/bahan visual dalam "
"persekitaran anda boleh dikaitkan dengan maklumat peribadi anda. Selain itu,"
" semasa anda melakukan rakaman, mikrofon atau kamera boleh menangkap audio "
"atau video yang tidak diingini, contohnya kamera boleh menangkap ahli "
"keluarga lain atau mikrofon boleh menangkap sesuatu yang anda katakan kepada"
" orang lain."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be associated with your name or other identifiers "
"in any way."
msgstr ""
"Rakaman anda tidak akan dikaitkan dengan nama anda atau pengecam lain dalam "
"apa jua cara."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be used to derive your real identity, and they will"
" not be made public."
msgstr ""
"Rakaman anda tidak akan digunakan untuk mendapatkan identiti sebenar anda, "
"dan ia tidak akan didedahkan kepada umum."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid ""
"By consenting to participate, you acknowledge that you are 18 years or "
"older, have read this consent form, agree to its contents, and agree to take"
" part in this research."
msgstr ""
"Dengan bersetuju untuk mengambil bahagian, anda mengakui bahawa anda berumur"
" 18 tahun ke atas, telah membaca borang kebenaran ini, bersetuju dengan "
"kandungannya, dan bersetuju untuk mengambil bahagian dalam penyelidikan ini."

