#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran keseluruhan"

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this online form is to give you information to help you "
"decide whether you want to take part in a research study."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan borang dalam talian ini adalah untuk memberi anda maklumat untuk "
"membantu anda memutuskan sama ada anda ingin mengambil bahagian dalam kajian"
" penyelidikan."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-overview"
msgid ""
"This research is being conducted by researchers at the Max-Planck-Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics."
msgstr ""
"Penyelidikan ini sedang dijalankan oleh penyelidik di Max-Planck-Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"Specifically, we aim to combine a wide range of behavioural methodologies to"
" characterize the ways in which people from diverse backgrounds internalize "
"and process external conditions, both in the auditory (e.g., speech, music) "
"and visual (e.g., faces, color) domains."
msgstr ""
"Secara khusus, kami menyasarkan untuk menggabungkan pelbagai metodologi "
"tingkah laku untuk mencirikan cara orang daripada pelbagai latar belakang "
"menghayati dan memproses keadaan luaran, kedua-dua dalam domain pendengaran "
"(cth., pertuturan, muzik) dan visual (cth., muka, warna)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study the role of experience and exposure "
"in creating and affecting our perception, decisions and actions."
msgstr ""
"Tujuan projek ini adalah untuk mengkaji peranan pengalaman dan pendedahan "
"dalam mencipta dan mempengaruhi persepsi, keputusan dan tindakan kita."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We are also interested in the way that these internal representations affect"
" human decision making and behaviour."
msgstr ""
"Kami juga berminat dengan cara perwakilan dalaman ini mempengaruhi pembuatan"
" keputusan dan tingkah laku manusia."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Audio-visual material will not be indexed by personal information but will "
"be linked to personal information by a key (such as “afasd12314asdasd”)."
msgstr ""
"Bahan audio-visual tidak akan diindeks oleh maklumat peribadi tetapi akan "
"dipautkan kepada maklumat peribadi dengan kunci (seperti "
"“afasd12314asdasd”)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"During data collection, audio-visual material will be recorded on a separate"
" server."
msgstr ""
"Semasa pengumpulan data, bahan audio-visual akan dirakam pada pelayan yang "
"berasingan."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Personal information will be stored separately from audio-visual materials "
"and encrypted using a strong encryption protocol (such as Advanced "
"Encryption Standard)."
msgstr ""
"Maklumat peribadi akan disimpan secara berasingan daripada bahan audio-"
"visual dan disulitkan menggunakan protokol penyulitan yang kuat (seperti "
"Standard Penyulitan Lanjutan)."

